sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Agent as DevOps Agent
    participant APIGW as API Gateway<br/>(SigV4 Auth)
    participant Server as MCP Server<br/>(Lambda)
    participant CB as Circuit Breaker
    participant Idem as Idempotency<br/>(DynamoDB)
    participant Policy as Policy Engine
    participant Redact as Redaction
    participant Jira as Jira Cloud<br/>(REST v3)
    participant SM as Secrets Manager
    participant Audit as CloudWatch<br/>Audit Log

    Note over Agent, Jira: WRITE PATH — e.g. add_comment with secrets in body

    Agent->>+APIGW: POST /prod/mcp (SigV4 signed)<br/>{"method":"tools/call","params":{"name":"add_comment",...}}
    APIGW->>APIGW: Verify IAM SigV4 signature
    APIGW->>+Server: Invoke Lambda (pass actor ARN)

    %% Circuit breaker check
    Server->>CB: is_open()?
    CB-->>Server: false (closed)

    %% Idempotency lookup
    Server->>+Idem: lookup(idempotency_key)
    Idem->>Idem: DynamoDB get_item
    Idem-->>-Server: None (cache miss)

    %% Policy check
    Server->>+Policy: check_field_writes(project_key, fields)
    Policy->>Policy: Load policy.yaml<br/>Resolve project rules
    Policy-->>-Server: OK (no forbidden fields)

    %% Redaction
    Server->>+Redact: redact_adf(body_adf)
    Redact->>Redact: Regex scan:<br/>AWS keys, emails, tokens, JWTs...
    Note right of Redact: "oncall@acme.com" →<br/>"[REDACTED:email]"<br/>"AKIA..." →<br/>"[REDACTED:aws_access_key]"
    Redact-->>-Server: Sanitized ADF

    %% Jira call
    Server->>+Jira: POST /rest/api/3/issue/{key}/comment<br/>(Basic auth, sanitized body)
    Note over SM, Jira: Credentials loaded once<br/>per cold start from<br/>Secrets Manager
    Jira-->>-Server: 201 {id: "10042", ...}

    %% Circuit breaker success
    Server->>CB: record_success()

    %% Idempotency record
    Server->>+Idem: record(idempotency_key, response)
    Idem->>Idem: DynamoDB put_item<br/>(ConditionExpression: attribute_not_exists)
    Idem-->>-Server: Recorded (TTL: 24h)

    %% Audit
    Server->>Audit: [AUDIT] {"event":"tool_ok","tool":"add_comment",...}

    Server-->>-APIGW: {"jsonrpc":"2.0","result":{"content":[...]}}
    APIGW-->>-Agent: 200 OK + Mcp-Session-Id header

    Note over Agent: Agent sees success.<br/>Has NO knowledge that<br/>body was redacted.
